  "notes": "Colleges and majors are verbatim from the official Arabic 'بَرامِج البكالوريوس' page (English names from the matching English page). The Arabic page spells the design programme 'فِسْم التَّصميم والتّواصُل البصريّ' (a typo of 'قسم'); it is written here as 'التَّصميم والتّواصُل البصريّ'. The 2026/2027 'Available Bachelor's Programs' PDF (English only) differs: it no longer lists Sustainable Infrastructure Systems Engineering, folds Interior Architecture into Architecture as a track, lists Game Design and Media Informatics as a joint SC/SABE programme, and adds a new 'Cultural and Natural Heritage' bachelor (SAHSS) whose Arabic name was not found, so it is omitted. Tracks (e.g. CS: Cyber Security / Data Science) are not listed as separate majors. Email: Office 365 tenant and OWA URL use gju.edu.jo (info@gju.edu.jo); no separate student subdomain was found, but the student address format was not verified. The 'teams' link is the official Office 365 sign-in (no direct Teams link on the site). Main campus is on Amman–Madaba Street (P.O. Box Amman 11180, campus in Mushaqar/Madaba governorate); coordinates from the official contact page's Google Maps link. Brand colour not verified."
